# Baseline GeoPackage perf fixtures are binary blobs (SQLite) that scale with
# parcel count into the MBs. Track them with git-LFS so clones stay small and
# diffs stay sane. After cloning, run `git lfs pull` to materialise them; the
# baseline-overlap-scaling scenario reads them straight off disk.
scenarios/fixtures/*.gpkg filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
